{"name": "Zodiac Finder", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Zodiac Finder — MyLLMos App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"275499756d\";color-scheme:light dark;--accent:#bf5af2}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:18px;background:#f2f2f7;color:#111}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#000;color:#eee}input,.card{background:#1c1c1e;color:#eee;border-color:#3a3a3c}}\nh1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px}\n.sub{font-size:13px;opacity:.6;margin-bottom:14px}\n.row{display:flex;gap:8px}\ninput{flex:1;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d1d1d6;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px;background:#fff;color:#111}\nbutton{border:0;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:0 18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}\n.card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:22px;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.1);display:none;border-top:5px solid var(--accent)}\n.card .sym{font-size:58px;line-height:1}\n.card .nm{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px}\n.card .dt{font-size:13px;opacity:.6;margin-top:2px}\n.badge{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:5px 13px;border-radius:16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff}\n.card .t{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;margin-top:14px}\n.card .k{font-size:13px;opacity:.7;margin-top:10px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n#status{font-size:13px;opacity:.7;min-height:16px;margin-top:10px}\n@media(min-width:768px){body{max-width:760px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}}\n</style></head><body>\n<h1>✨ Zodiac Finder</h1>\n<div class=\"sub\">Enter your birthday to discover your star sign and traits. Works offline.</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><input id=\"dob\" type=\"date\" aria-label=\"your birthday\"><button onclick=\"find()\">Find my sign</button></div>\n<div id=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"card\" id=\"card\"></div>\n<script>\nvar store=window.myllmStorage||{getItem:function(){return Promise.resolve(null)},setItem:function(){return Promise.resolve()}};\nvar EL={Fire:'#ff453a',Earth:'#30d158',Air:'#32ade6',Water:'#0a84ff'};\nvar DATA={\n Aries:{s:'♈',el:'Fire',d:'Mar 21 – Apr 19',t:'Bold, energetic and brave — a natural pioneer who dives in headfirst.',k:'Confident · Driven · Spontaneous'},\n Taurus:{s:'♉',el:'Earth',d:'Apr 20 – May 20',t:'Steady, patient and loyal, with a love of comfort and life’s good things.',k:'Reliable · Grounded · Sensual'},\n Gemini:{s:'♊',el:'Air',d:'May 21 – Jun 20',t:'Curious, witty and sociable — a quick mind that loves to talk and learn.',k:'Adaptable · Clever · Expressive'},\n Cancer:{s:'♋',el:'Water',d:'Jun 21 – Jul 22',t:'Caring, intuitive and protective, deeply tuned to home and feelings.',k:'Nurturing · Loyal · Sensitive'},\n Leo:{s:'♌',el:'Fire',d:'Jul 23 – Aug 22',t:'Warm, generous and confident — born to shine and lead with heart.',k:'Charismatic · Proud · Creative'},\n Virgo:{s:'♍',el:'Earth',d:'Aug 23 – Sep 22',t:'Practical, precise and helpful, with a sharp eye for detail.',k:'Analytical · Kind · Diligent'},\n Libra:{s:'♎',el:'Air',d:'Sep 23 – Oct 22',t:'Charming, fair and sociable — a lover of balance, beauty and harmony.',k:'Diplomatic · Romantic · Easygoing'},\n Scorpio:{s:'♏',el:'Water',d:'Oct 23 – Nov 21',t:'Intense, passionate and determined, with deep emotional currents.',k:'Magnetic · Loyal · Fearless'},\n Sagittarius:{s:'♐',el:'Fire',d:'Nov 22 – Dec 21',t:'Adventurous, optimistic and free-spirited — always chasing the horizon.',k:'Bold · Honest · Curious'},\n Capricorn:{s:'♑',el:'Earth',d:'Dec 22 – Jan 19',t:'Ambitious, disciplined and patient — a steady climber who plays the long game.',k:'Driven · Responsible · Wise'},\n Aquarius:{s:'♒',el:'Air',d:'Jan 20 – Feb 18',t:'Original, independent and humane — an inventive thinker ahead of the curve.',k:'Visionary · Free · Friendly'},\n Pisces:{s:'♓',el:'Water',d:'Feb 19 – Mar 20',t:'Dreamy, compassionate and artistic, with a rich imagination and a big heart.',k:'Empathic · Creative · Gentle'}};\nvar EARLY=['Capricorn','Aquarius','Pisces','Aries','Taurus','Gemini','Cancer','Leo','Virgo','Libra','Scorpio','Sagittarius'];\nvar LATE =['Aquarius','Pisces','Aries','Taurus','Gemini','Cancer','Leo','Virgo','Libra','Scorpio','Sagittarius','Capricorn'];\nvar LAST =[19,18,20,19,20,20,22,22,22,22,21,21];\nfunction el(i){return document.getElementById(i)}\nfunction sunSign(m,d){return d<=LAST[m-1]?EARLY[m-1]:LATE[m-1]}\n\nfunction find(){\n  var v=el('dob').value;\n  if(!v){el('status').textContent='Pick your birthday first.';return}\n  el('status').textContent='';store.setItem('dob',v);\n  var parts=v.split('-');var m=+parts[1],d=+parts[2];\n  var name=sunSign(m,d),s=DATA[name];\n  var c=el('card');c.style.borderTopColor=EL[s.el];\n  c.innerHTML='<div class=\"sym\">'+s.s+'</div><div class=\"nm\">'+name+'</div>'+\n    '<div class=\"dt\">'+s.d+'</div>'+\n    '<span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:'+EL[s.el]+'\">'+s.el+' sign</span>'+\n    '<div class=\"t\">'+s.t+'</div><div class=\"k\">'+s.k+'</div>';\n  c.style.display='block';\n  if(window.myllmHaptic)myllmHaptic('success');\n}\nel('dob').addEventListener('change',find);\nstore.getItem('dob').then(function(v){if(v){el('dob').value=v;find()}});\n</script></body></html>\n", "kind": "html", "iconSymbol": "sparkles", "iconColor": "purple"}